Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: muibuilderqt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt6/C++ GUI designer for Amiga MUI interfaces (alpha)
 MuiBuilderQt is a modern Qt6/C++ port of Eric Totel's classic MUI-Builder
 (v2.3), an interactive GUI designer for the Amiga MUI (Magic User
 Interface) toolkit. Design MUI windows and menus visually and generate
 ready-to-compile C code for m68k-amigaos-gcc or vbcc.
 .
 It integrates with AmigaED (File > New Project > GUI Builder Projects)
 but also works completely standalone.
 .
 This is an early ALPHA release - see /usr/share/doc/muibuilderqt for
 details, known limitations and the exact license terms.
